{"availability":"available","full":"WICG/ua-client-hints","name":"ua-client-hints","description":"Wouldn't it be nice if `User-Agent` was a (set of) client hints?","category":"Other","language":"Bikeshed","stars":623,"forks":91,"created":"2018-10-24T12:20:52Z","updated":"2026-10-06T14:38:10Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://wicg.github.io/ua-client-hints/","topics":["shipping-chromium"],"demo":"https://wicg.github.io/ua-client-hints/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T07:58:15.362Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T07:58:15.362Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T07:58:15.362Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:53:44.946Z","stars":623,"forks":91},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:49:06.994Z","stars":623,"forks":91},{"at":"2026-10-12T07:58:15.362Z","stars":623,"forks":91}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["This repository hosts the User Agent Client Hints (UA-CH) specification.","UA-CH introduces the following Client Hints HTTP headers and a corresponding JavaScript API:","WoW64 indicates that a 32-bit User-Agent application is running on a 64-bit Windows machine. It was commonly used to know which NPAPI plugin installer should be offered for download. It's included here for backwards compatibility considerations, to provide a one to one mapping from the UA string of certain browsers to UA-CH. Note that not all browsers today have exposed this, and it may not always return a useful value."],"features":["Sec-CH-UA-Platform-Version","Sec-CH-UA-Form-Factors","Sec-CH-UA-Full-Version (deprecated in favor of Sec-CH-UA-Full-Version-List)","Sec-CH-UA-Full-Version-List"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/WICG/ua-client-hints/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"4823fd3d9c385390bef223ca2f68146ba4717b5cc46775ff5c2975c919a49f95","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:45.235Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:45.235Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This repository hosts the User Agent Client Hints (UA